"耕卒。","note":"耕卒。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiugeng:p001","start_codepoint":4,"end_codepoint":7,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiugeng","source_id":"s-songshu-049-yuqiugeng-ws2118585"},{"id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiugeng:succession_record1-0","kind":"succession_record","person_id":"t8a_uoo_qhb_A","source_quote":"子耕嗣","reading":"前段追論虞丘進功進爵為子；受封及傳至齊時的爵系，宋與南史對讀。","note":"前段追論虞丘進功進爵為子；受封及傳至齊時的爵系，宋與南史對讀。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiugeng:p001","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":3,"human_reviewed":false,"source_role":"耕","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiugeng","source_id":"s-songshu-049-yuqiugeng-ws2118585"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-song049-yuqiu-xizu-geng","subject_person_id":"t8a_uoo_qhb_AA","object_person_id":"t8a_uoo_qhb_A","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"耕卒，子襲祖嗣","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-049","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession","source_id":"s-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession-ws2118585","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p004","quote":"子耕嗣。耕卒，子襲祖嗣。襲祖卒，世寶嗣。齊受禪，國除。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p004:m0008","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p004:m0001"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"正文明子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-song049-yuqiu-geng-jin","subject_person_id":"t8a_uoo_qhb_A","object_person_id":"t8a_uoo_qhb","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"lineage":"paternal","source_term":"子"},"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"全傳自具名虞丘進以下至卒官的四個連續原段，緊接子耕嗣。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-049","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession","source_id":"s-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession-ws2118585","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p001","quote":"虞丘進字豫之，東海郯人也。少時隨謝玄討苻堅，有功，封關內侯。隆安中，從高祖征孫恩，戍句章城，被圍數十日，無日不戰，身被數創。至餘姚呵浦，破賊張驃，追至海鹽故治及婁縣。於蒲濤口與孫恩水戰，又被重創。追恩至鬱洲，又至石鹿頭，還海鹽大柱，頻戰有功。元興元年，又從高祖東征臨海，於石步固與盧循相守二十餘日。二年，又從高祖至東陽，破徐道覆。其年，又至臨松穴破賊，追至永嘉千江，又至安固，累戰皆有功。","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p001:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-049","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession","source_id":"s-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession-ws2118585","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p002","quote":"三年，從平京城，定京邑，除燕國內史。義熙二年，除龍驤將軍，封龍川縣五等侯。從高祖伐廣固，於臨朐破賊。盧循逼京邑，孟昶、諸葛長民等建議奉天子過江，進廷議不可，面折昶等，高祖甚嘉之。獻計伐樹，樹柵石頭。除鄱陽太守，將軍如故。統馬步十八隊，於東道出鄱陽，至五畝嶠。循遣將英紏為上饒令，千餘人守故城，進攻破之。循又遣童敏之為鄱陽太守，據郡，進從餘干步道趣鄱陽，敏之退走，追破之，斬首數百。復隨劉藩至始興，討斬徐道覆。"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-049","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession","source_id":"s-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession-ws2118585","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p003","quote":"八年，除寧蠻護軍、尋陽太守，領文武二千從征劉毅。事平，補太尉行參軍，尋加振威將軍。九年，以前後功封望蔡縣男，食邑五百戶，加龍驤將軍。討司馬休之，又有戰功。軍還，除輔國將軍、山陽太守。宋臺令書除秦郡太守，督陳留郡事，將軍如故。元熙二年，宋王令書以為高祖第四子義康右將軍司馬。永初二年，遷太子右衞率。明年，卒官，時年六十。追論討司馬休之功，進爵為子，增邑三百戶。"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-049","chapter_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession","source_id":"s-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession-ws2118585","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p004","quote":"子耕嗣。耕卒，子襲祖嗣。襲祖卒，世寶嗣。齊受禪，國除。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p004:m0001"}],"context":{"kind":"biographical_child_continuation","paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p001","c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p002","c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p003","c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p004"],"parent_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p001:m0000","child_mention_id":"c-songshu-049-yuqiu-jin-succession:p004:m0001","rationale":"全傳自具名虞丘進以下至卒官的四個連續原段，緊接子耕嗣。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false},"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"u